st of the Story, dying off by the time of the next Story should it otherwise survive. Conscription once undergone cannot be undone.<br /> <br /> <br /> Construct.Order your industrial base to immediately begin work on a structure of some sort, either growing a specialized life form or piling building materials in short order. Alternatively, this may be used to produce items on a large scale.<br /> <br /> <br /> Spy. Order a covert band of spies, small things to shadow a given person or area, informing you of goings on in the location discretely.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> now.... for Diplomacy and Science.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Interesting. How does one gain or regain Colony Attributes? Is it just an EXP thing (with gathering resources in-game) or is it purely roleplay?<br /> <br /> Also, what about 11 Autonomy Monarchs completely losing control of their Colonies, becoming Deposed while 0 Autonomy Monarchs are mentally consumed by the bestial mentality of their underlings, going Feral.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 03-12-2016, 10:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T08:00:00-08:00","id":846067,"title":"","content":"On a completely random note, do you know the anime Parasyte?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\"