\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T09:17:55-08:00","id":846117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Almarck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless?p=846115#post846115\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I dunno actually. I need ideas for Colony &quot;spells&quot;. Basic abiltiies that are universal.<br /> <br /> <br /> As a general rule, they should be able to use any Resources by the Colony, but the prefered resources are more cost efficient.<br /> <br /> Conscription for instance allows you to divert noncombat Drones into the army whilst you spend military resources on birthing new warriors, but the conscripted social workers aren't as efficient as the warriors.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'll have a go. I'll get back to you when I have something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T09:18:51-08:00","id":846119,"title":"","content":"Thanks. I'll be driving somewhere for the meanwhile","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T09:26:30-08:00","id":846129,"title":"","content":"Here's my first go at a Colony ability.<br /> <br /> <b>Projection:</b> The Monarch slaves the minds of his colony to his, halting whatever activity they are currently engaging in but allowing him to use telepathy as if he had 1 higher Authority. If the Monarch already has an Authority of 10, he can now project his mind beyond the conventional universe (Perhaps into the Void?). This puts a great deal of strain on the lesser minds however, and renders the colony unable to take any further action for a number of hours equal to the Monarch's Authority.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure what this would do with Authority 10 Monarchs. talking of which, don't you think the jump from planet-wide telepathy to infinite is a little big? I would say let the Authority 10 Monarchs be able to use it anywhere within a light-year. Plus, that would mean that with this you could have especially powerful Monarchs acting as a 'transmitter' between star systems, along with space-warping. And yes, I'm shamelessly copying the Astropaths from Warhammer 40k.<br /> <br /> last thing, and I am <i>begging </i> you here, can the 5-dot colony bonus from the Principality of Staves be making a biological Stargate? Please? Pwetty pwease?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 03-12-2016, 12:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T09:44:32-08:00","id":846149,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless?p=846129#post846129\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here's my first go at a Colony ability.<br /> <br /> <b>Projection:</b> The Monarch slaves the minds of his colony to his, halting whatever activity they are currently engaging in but allowing him to use telepathy as if he had 1 higher Authority. If the Monarch already has an Authority of 10, he can now project his mind beyond the conventional universe (Perhaps into the Void?). This puts a great deal of strain on the lesser minds however, and renders the colony unable to take any further action for a number of hours equal to the Monarch's Authority.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure what this would do with Authority 10 Monarchs. talking of which, don't you think the jump from planet-wide telepathy to infinite is a little big? I would say let the Authority 10 Monarchs be able to use it anywhere within a light-year. Plus, that would mean that with this you could have especially powerful Monarchs acting as a 'transmitter' between star systems, along with space-warping. And yes, I'm shamelessly copying the Astropaths from Warhammer 40k.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm actually going to be redoing telepathy distances to make adjustments for the fact that every Monarch is now with a Court. Signal boosting towers are going to now be everywhere to amp up the range via some sort of shared massive neural network underground. Think wifi!<br /> <br /> <br /> Anyways, I am more kinda asking about things pertaining to the 5 Colony attributes. They cost resources to use.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T09:47:46-08:00","id":846152,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Almarck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless?p=846149#post846149\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I'm actually going to be redoing telepathy distances to make adjustments for the fact that every Monarch is now with a Court. Signal boosting towers are going to now be everywhere to amp up the range via some sort of shared massive neural network underground. Think wifi!<br /> <br /> <br /> Anyways, I am more kinda asking about things pertaining to the 5 Colony attributes. They cost resources to use.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> OK, sorry, I guess I misunderstood. I'll have a go at them then.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T10:52:38-08:00","id":846183,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless?p=846152#post846152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> OK, sorry, I guess I misunderstood. I'll have a go at them then.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I already have Concscript for Military.<br /> <br /> I just need something for the other 4.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5695-aceofalmonds\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar5695_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5695\" data-vbnamecard=\"5695\">AceOfAlmonds</a> Your take?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T12:04:47-08:00","id":846205,"title":"","content":"OK, here's my second attempt.<br /> <br /> <b>Supply: </b>The Monarch commands his industrial centres to synthesize materials or commodities, either to trade with another colony, for an individual construction project or simply to supply Swarms or Servants working in the field. This can only create raw materials or form them into simple shapes. For example, this could be used to produce blocks of stone but not a statue.<br /> Although the process used to enact this ability are a combination of biological factories and psi-chemistry that can produce most anything from most anything else the Storyteller may limit exceedingly rare materials such as precious metals or gems. Bear in mind that things produced through Supply will not necessarily be a perfect copy of their earthly counterparts. Wood will behave similarly but might not have a grain or rings.<br /> The amount of points that must be spent to create a given resource is dependent upon the rarity, complexity and desired bulk of the final product.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T13:43:28-08:00","id":846256,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless?p=846205#post846205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">OK, here's my second attempt.<br /> <br /> <b>Supply: </b>The Monarch commands his industrial centres to synthesize materials or commodities, either to trade with another colony, for an individual construction project or simply to supply Swarms or Servants working in the field. This can only create raw materials or form them into simple shapes. For example, this could be used to produce blocks of stone but not a statue.<br /> Although the process used to enact this ability are a combination of biological factories and psi-chemistry that can produce most anything from most anything else the Storyteller may limit exceedingly rare materials such as precious metals or gems. Bear in mind that things produced through Supply will not necessarily be a perfect copy of their earthly counterparts. Wood will behave similarly but might not have a grain or rings.<br /> The amount of points that must be spent to create a given resource is dependent upon the rarity, complexity and desired bulk of the final product.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> This is... Industry, right? Seems good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.