.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless?p=847033#post847033\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So do you have 3 'primary' principalities which you get the biggest discount on and 2 secondaries which you get a smaller discount?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> No, they all get the same discount. I just did this for filing purposes.<br /> <br /> <br /> Either way, it tells us what we need. 2 Prinipalities that can slot into Marshal. Onee that's Diplomacy related, the other is Stewardship<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-14T07:52:36-07:00","id":847066,"title":"","content":"Oh goodness, there's been lots of discussion over the weekend. I've read through it; some responses:<br /> <br /> 1) Swarm ideas: Diplomacy or Espionage could get an info-gather task; the former finding public/mortal information, the latter finding secret/supernatural information. Military could have some kind of defending-an-area thing. Economic...act as temporary dots in Resources? Honestly, I'm having some trouble with these; Colony-management sounds less interesting to me than dealing with the fact that you've been infected with an alien microbe and now have weird powers and mutations and you're not sure how human you still are and you keep having these megalomaniac urges to take over the world.<br /> <br /> 2) Powers: I agree that Records and Clocks should be merged. Based on the structure so far, it looks like each has one power that they and only they get; the other two are secondary for another group. For Marshal secondary, I'd like to give them Crowns, but that means that Diplomat's new power needs to be unique to them. Maybe splitting Crowns into single-target and multi-target (along the lines of Dominate and Majesty; former is more powerful/stronger control, while latter affects more targets but is weaker)? With Marshals sharing the multi-target one. Scepters for multi-target, Crowns for single-target. Which leaves Stewards, who have to share with Marshals. Hmm. Well, armies need supplies; stewards grow supplies. What if there was a growth-power, something for generating a lot of small things, like food/bullets/etc? Call it Seeds. Distinct from Hammers, since Hammers is more about single big things? So then the list looks like this (italic marks unique powers)<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Marshal</span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Blades - melee</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Bows </i>- ranged</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Plates - armor, defense</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Scepters - subversion, conversion</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Seeds - resources, supplies</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Scribe </span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Censers - smokescreen, gasses, incense</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Chalices - poisons and potions</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Quills - telepathy, peaceful action</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Spheres </i>- scry</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Staves - warp, space</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Stewards </span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Hammers </i>- create</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Plates - armor, defense</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Records - post/precognition, time</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Seeds - resources, supplies</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Staves - warp, space</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Diplomat </span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Crowns</i> - command, control</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Quills - telepathy, peaceful action</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Records - post/precognition, time</span><