walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-15T14:28:07-07:00","id":847865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Almarck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless?p=847857#post847857\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That could work. Perhaps the older conspiracy actually had a means of using them topside but it was lost in the ages since the Geodic war.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> now for a name...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Custos Aeterna? (Eternal Guardians)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-15T14:33:54-07:00","id":847868,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Almarck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless?p=847857#post847857\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That could work. Perhaps the older conspiracy actually had a means of using them topside but it was lost in the ages since the Geodic war.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> now for a name...</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh. Maybe instead of their special tech needing the weird physics of the Other place specifically, maybe key components merely decay in Real space. This allows for brief usages when needs must, and for a short &quot;golden age&quot; after their prior defeat of the Geodics. After their victory, they used their ultra-tec to reign as god-king protectors... before their shinnies rusted/broke down. Could even tie it into olden tales of gods or such, if you want (kinda like Lord of Light).<br /> <br /> How about Haans-Chowdhury Productions, at least as their modern incarnation? (Yes, I Back-ronym'd HCP)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-15T15:13:29-07:00","id":847887,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Shade</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Mysteries are webs: A perfect snare and hiding spot, easy to get tangled, but can be unraveled</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">A spider lying in wait above their invisible webs, a venomous scorpion that hides under stones and sands, a praying mantis that blends against trees hidden in plain sight, the assassin who holds his knife against his victims neck, threatening murder to gain a valuable piece of information\u2026.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">A Shade is meant to be a sneak, a master of subterfuge, stealth, and conspiracy. His task is simple, to learn of the hidden plots, the threats to the realm brewing underneath the notice of others, dispatching them himself if he needs to. A Shade\u2019s Colony resembles something like a network of spies and thieves, individual Drones spying upon one another as if paranoid about the threat of covert operatives...</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Though it should be no surprise that many Shades are loyal to their Courts, many Kings feel threatened about letting an individual who could secretly end their lives and not face repercussions so close to their highest Circles. Still, they serve a vital function, even if their actions escape the bounds of honor or border on breaking Law.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Above all else, Shades value pragmatism</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b> Noble Form Benefits </b></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Favored Principalities </b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Bows - ranged</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Censers - smokescreen, gasses, incense</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Chalices - poisons, potions</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Cloaks - flight, sneaking, gravity</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Veils </i></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">- shadows, illusions, lying</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Diplomat</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Understanding others leads to prosperity. Mutualism is key.</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The ants coopted the aphids as men would for cattle, bees work together with flowers in unspoken manner the plants paying honey in exchange for transferring pollen. The man who speaks to the king of another nation.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Diplomacy is vital for maintaining nations. If members of every province did not communicate with each other and at least had some form of relatability between each other, the Unions would collapse. Just as well, two nations could not exist peacefully without first extending contact and exchange. The Kingmakers knew that social cohesion was needed for the Monarchs and the Colonies to persist, for the fiery free will of their human halves was not so easily controlled. Diplomats were the result</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">A Diplomat looks outward from himself, focusing on those around him to ensure peace through cooperation. Within or within separate Courts, they were tasked to maintain social order, to ensure that even if conflict happened, it would not result in permanent losses and that afterwards the opposed nations would not degenerate into constant fighting. That isn\u2019t to say that Diplomats only focus on other Monarchs; no, they also must bear in mind the other creatures that lurk under mankind\u2019s shadow, for one never knows where a good ally could arise from.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Unlike true diplomats however, these Monarchs possess their own armies and powerful telepathic abilities.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Diplomats favor relationship skills and personal reliability</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b> Noble Form Benefits </b></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Favored Principalities </b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Cloaks - flight, sneaking, gravity</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Crowns </i></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">- command, control</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Quills - telepathy, peaceful action</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Records - post/precognition, time</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Scepters - subversion, conversion</span><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-15T15:14:06-07:00","id":847889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless?p=847868#post847868\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh. Maybe instead of their special tech needing the weird physics of the Other place specifically, maybe key components merely decay in Real space. This allows for brief usages when needs must, and for a short &quot;golden age&quot; after their prior defeat of the Geodics. After their victory, they used their ultra-tec to reign as god-king protectors... before their shinnies rusted/broke down. Could even tie it into olden tales of gods or such, if you want (kinda like Lord of Light).<br /> <br /> How about Haans-Chowdhury Productions, at least as their modern incarnation? (Yes, I Back-ronym'd HCP)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> How advanced are you thinking of... astetic wise atleast?<br /> <br /> <br /> Worth noting that the Geodics are basically a race made up of mini-Ramiels...<br /> <br /> I'm thinking of using both names actually. Eternal Guardians for their real name. and HCP for their public name.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-15T16:18:50-07:00","id":847910,"title":"","content":"I take it this is an Alien Fansplat? If so, it looks interesting and it has my like to it. Keep up the awesome work guys. :3","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Doing: Siren the D